      "text": "God that knowest thy thoughts, D&C 6:16. Look unto me in every thought, D&C 6:36. give it unto you, when you took no thought, D&C 9:7. you shall have a stupor of thought, D&C 9:9. cast away your idle thoughts, D&C 88:69. thoughts that I shall put into your hearts, D&C 100:5. let virtue garnish thy thoughts, D&C 121:45.",
